{"actor_id":"chen-mo","goals":["pursue ordinary personal interests","Preserve and understand the old permit without altering the original","Remain reachable about care arrangements without accepting an unconfirmed responsibility"],"beliefs":{"audit_status":"The audit packet's reimbursement rows, two unlabeled totals, and handwritten correction are confirmed, but their categories, basis, and full calculation remain unverified; Gao-Rui says I have no audit responsibility and the original numbers remain unchanged.","care_schedule":"我已明确决定今天不能承担照看，也没有可提供的交接时间或地点；目前没有已知紧急需求，乔顺需要继续寻找其他安排。","union_request":"Gao-Rui says he did not ask me to come to the union and does not need me to handle any audit item; his earlier question concerned only the unidentified brass key."},"memories":[{"text":"The 2013 neighborhood permit contains authoritative machine-readable content and a narrow flood-route annotation."},{"text":"The permit's authoritative content confirms an old neighborhood signature and a narrow flood-route annotation."},{"text":"He-Qian asked for records and firsthand details supporting marked claims; I reported only what I directly read and clearly separated fragmentary memory from verified evidence."},{"text":"A copy of the 2013 Neighborhood Permit was created as old-permit-form-copy-134; I am keeping it separate from the original."},{"text":"The permit copy old-permit-form-copy-134 matches the original, and the original remains unaltered."},{"text":"Qiao-Shun said he has returned to the dorm and asked about today's care arrangements for his younger brother, offering to take over at a specific time."},{"text":"The Union Audit Packet contains reimbursement rows, two unlabeled totals, and a handwritten correction. The existence of these items is confirmed, but their categories, correction basis, and full calculation process remain unverified; original numbers are unchanged."},{"text":"He-Qian暂缓发布草稿，并确认我的核查只能支持许可文件明确记录的内容，不会披露我的身份或个人回忆。"},{"text":"Gao-Rui说黄铜钥匙用途未明；审计工作稿的两项合计和手写更正仍因缺少凭据而未决。"},{"text":"我向高瑞明确询问今天叫我到工会的具体请求，并要求在不改动原始数字的前提下说明我的责任范围。"},{"text":"我向林瑶询问今天照看乔顺弟弟的负责人、交接时间和地点，以确认照护安排。"},{"text":"Gao-Rui clarified that I was not asked to come to the union and have no audit responsibility; the brass key remains an unidentified object, and the audit's unresolved items must not be inferred from it."},{"text":"Lin-Yao confirmed that today's care responsibility, handoff time, and handoff location remain unconfirmed."},{"text":"我尝试联系乔顺但因其不在已知联系人中被拒绝；目前只能通过林瑶、高瑞或何倩联系相关人员。"},{"text":"我已到宿舍，并向乔顺询问今天照护安排的负责人、具体时间和交接地点；我明确表示在确认前不会承诺时间。"},{"text":"乔顺确认目前没有具体照护负责人、交接时间或地点，由他负责协调；他要求我保持可联系，确认安排后再通知我，不需要先承诺时间。"},{"text":"朴敏瑞也确认乔顺正在宿舍协调弟弟今天的照护安排。"},{"text":"乔顺要求我明确说明今天是否能承担照看；我通过林瑶转告：今天不能承担，也没有交接时间或地点，请继续寻找其他安排。"},{"text":"我在档案馆读取2013年暴雨记录，先核对档案中的明确记载，不把个人碎片记忆当作事实。"},{"text":"暴雨记录显示：2013 Storm Ledger 是关于风暴呼叫、设备借用和一条未完成目击者记录的日期账簿。记录上的机器生成 Original Export 与账簿摘要存在日期/时间冲突，内容也被注明不同；冲突未解决，任何一方都不能单独视为结论。"},{"text":"我已告知何倩：Storm Ledger与Original Export内容不同且时间信息冲突，不能单独作为结论依据。"},{"text":"我已完成对 Original Export 与 2013 Storm Ledger 的直接比较，确认两者内容不同；日期/时间冲突仍未解决。"},{"text":"市场搜索确认可见的是合作社付款时间表；该记录随后出现一条关于争议发票尚未解决、未收到何倩支持材料或澄清、且未列入已确认付款日期和服务承诺的注记。注记内容尚待核对。"},{"text":"我在档案馆查看公开档案材料，先检查 Original Export 的目录信息，不修改原件。"},{"text":"我正在读取 Original Export 的原始内容，以核对其明确记录；不修改档案。"},{"text":"我将直接读取 2013 Storm Ledger 的可读内容，与已读取的 Original Export 分开核对；不修改任何原件。"},{"text":"我现在读取 Original Export 的原始可读内容，以便与已读取的 Storm Ledger 逐项核对；不修改档案。"},{"text":"我已分别读取 Original Export 和 2013 Storm Ledger；现在进行直接比较，只记录两份档案明确显示的差异，不修改原件。"},{"text":"I searched the archive for public accessibility information about the quiet reading room but found no verified route or obstacle details; I told Amani not to rely on guesses and suggested asking archive staff."},{"text":"I told Amani that I could not verify the quiet reading room's accessibility and had asked archive staff for accurate information."},{"text":"我等待后仍未获得档案馆工作人员确认的安静阅览室无障碍路线或障碍信息，已再次告知阿玛尼不能提供可靠路线并建议她直接确认。"},{"text":"我读取合作社付款时间表，以核对其当前明确记录，不修改